WEBVTT

00:00:01.586 --> 00:00:04.964
"10 Years Ago"

00:00:14.015 --> 00:00:15.600
Hurry! Hurry!

00:00:15.850 --> 00:00:17.185
Yes, all right...

00:00:17.435 --> 00:00:19.520
Urgh! I'm going ahead!

00:00:19.770 --> 00:00:22.815
Fam! Wait!

00:00:35.995 --> 00:00:37.788
People of the world...

00:00:38.039 --> 00:00:41.542
Today shall be a day to remember.

00:00:41.792 --> 00:00:44.420
May this celebration of peace and friendship

00:00:44.670 --> 00:00:47.256
be spoken of for generations to come.

00:00:47.506 --> 00:00:53.304
To the Grand Lake we swear our
everlasting friendship and peace...

00:00:55.014 --> 00:00:58.726
...by now holding a Grand Race!

00:01:03.022 --> 00:01:06.150
Hurray for the Grand Race!

00:01:06.234 --> 00:01:12.823
<i>No matter what might await us there</i>

00:01:13.074 --> 00:01:21.499
<i>I'll go to unexplored territory with you</i>

00:01:29.757 --> 00:01:37.807
<i>I just had a short dream</i>

00:01:38.057 --> 00:01:42.436
<i>In it, I saw your back</i>

00:01:42.687 --> 00:01:48.609
<i>Was it the past? The future?</i>

00:01:48.859 --> 00:01:59.370
<i>Ignore the needle on that meter
pointing to the red zone</i>

00:01:59.620 --> 00:02:02.498
<i>And go where the tailwinds
and your feelings point you</i>

00:02:02.748 --> 00:02:08.671
<i>Every time I flap my wings, it makes me realize</i>

00:02:08.921 --> 00:02:14.218
<i>That there are skies
I'll never be able to see again</i>

00:02:14.468 --> 00:02:19.724
<i>But if you still want to take flight</i>

00:02:19.974 --> 00:02:26.522
<i>Then I will be your wings</i>

00:02:57.428 --> 00:02:59.680
Atamora! Kaiser!

00:03:01.432 --> 00:03:02.933
You're here to cheer us on?

00:03:03.184 --> 00:03:03.976
Yeah!

00:03:04.226 --> 00:03:06.479
You better win, okay?!

00:03:06.729 --> 00:03:09.148
Who do you think you're talkin' to, Fam?

00:03:09.398 --> 00:03:12.735
If you lose, you hafta scrub
KartoffePs toilets for a whole year!

00:03:12.985 --> 00:03:16.781
In that case, if we win,
you gotta start eating carrots, Fam!

00:03:17.031 --> 00:03:18.908
How come?!

00:03:23.537 --> 00:03:24.955
Good luck, Dad!

00:03:25.206 --> 00:03:27.333
--Here's a good luck charm!
--Got it!

00:03:27.583 --> 00:03:28.793
Do I get one too?

00:03:29.043 --> 00:03:30.753
Yeah! Here's yours, Kaiser!

00:03:31.003 --> 00:03:33.172
Ooh! We're unbeatable now!

00:03:34.215 --> 00:03:36.258
The hell with you!

00:03:36.509 --> 00:03:38.344
The Exiles ditched your lousy asses!

00:03:38.594 --> 00:03:40.888
Quit actin' like you own this world!

00:03:41.138 --> 00:03:45.309
What?! You're the impudent twits
who've barged into other people's lands!

00:03:45.559 --> 00:03:47.728
Say what?! You lookin' for a fight?!

00:03:48.771 --> 00:03:50.481
Who the hell are you?! Let go!

00:03:50.731 --> 00:03:54.110
Cool it. Are you trying
to sully this historic day?

00:03:54.360 --> 00:03:58.656
Why are they fighting?
This is the Grand Race and all...

00:03:58.906 --> 00:04:02.034
--Yeah...
--Everyone will calm down eventually.

00:04:02.284 --> 00:04:05.121
In fact, that's what today's race is all about.

00:04:08.332 --> 00:04:11.710
It's time for the second race
of the final qualifying round!

00:04:11.961 --> 00:04:12.753
Five!

00:04:13.003 --> 00:04:14.630
Four! Three!

00:04:14.880 --> 00:04:17.091
Two! One!

00:04:29.812 --> 00:04:30.938
Wow!

00:04:31.188 --> 00:04:32.690
Millia.

00:04:36.986 --> 00:04:40.406
Welcome to the Grand Race, King Turan.

00:04:40.656 --> 00:04:42.950
Augusta Farahnéz.

00:04:43.200 --> 00:04:46.954
Today has been a truly festive event.

00:04:47.204 --> 00:04:49.123
It is a pleasure to meet you.

00:04:49.373 --> 00:04:51.750
Augusta Farahnéz.

00:04:52.001 --> 00:04:56.464
How do you do, adorable Turan princesses?

00:04:56.714 --> 00:04:58.716
My name is Liliana.

00:04:58.966 --> 00:05:01.760
L-I'm... Millia.

00:05:05.848 --> 00:05:08.100
Oh, my. Have they startled you?

00:05:08.350 --> 00:05:10.478
Are they your guards?

00:05:10.728 --> 00:05:12.104
Yes.

00:05:12.354 --> 00:05:17.902
They're angels who've come from
the land of a white sky to protect me!

00:05:18.152 --> 00:05:19.778
Angels?

00:05:21.530 --> 00:05:23.449
--Kaiser's in the lead!
--Dad!

00:05:23.699 --> 00:05:25.618
Go! Leave 'em in the dust!

00:05:25.868 --> 00:05:27.411
Be careful!

00:05:29.622 --> 00:05:30.915
Whoa, he's awesome!

00:05:31.165 --> 00:05:35.878
That's the latest Notos model.
It has 20% more engine power!

00:05:36.128 --> 00:05:39.423
Wow, you're amazing, Gisey!

00:05:39.673 --> 00:05:40.424
Oh!

00:05:40.674 --> 00:05:43.344
That's an Ades Federation Heavy Vanship!

00:05:43.594 --> 00:05:45.638
People still use those old things?!

00:05:45.888 --> 00:05:48.182
Don't talk bad about the Shaharz!

00:05:48.432 --> 00:05:50.726
Hah! It's no match for our Vanships!

00:05:50.976 --> 00:05:52.895
Say what, you dirty Sky Pirate?!

00:05:53.145 --> 00:05:55.648
Not so fast, you kids!

00:05:55.898 --> 00:05:59.109
Here are some treats from Her Majesty!

00:05:59.360 --> 00:06:00.653
Can we have some?

00:06:00.903 --> 00:06:03.739
--Yeah!
--Oh! All right, Ades!

00:06:03.989 --> 00:06:05.658
See? We're not so bad!

00:06:07.451 --> 00:06:09.537
Hey, now! Don't push!

00:06:19.964 --> 00:06:24.802
Augusta Farahnéz, after working
tirelessly to negotiate with other lands,

00:06:25.052 --> 00:06:27.805
has finally made world peace a reality!

00:06:28.055 --> 00:06:33.435
It is entirely because of her stalwart
conviction and warmhearted spirit

00:06:33.686 --> 00:06:36.230
that the world has come together now.

00:06:36.480 --> 00:06:38.941
She truly is a remarkable woman!

00:06:59.420 --> 00:07:02.172
Oh, my. Whatever is the matter, you two?

00:07:02.423 --> 00:07:04.008
Millia...

00:07:04.258 --> 00:07:07.386
Lukia. You're frightening her.

00:07:07.636 --> 00:07:09.305
What should I do?

00:07:09.555 --> 00:07:11.599
Smile for her.

00:07:11.849 --> 00:07:13.475
I see.

00:07:17.146 --> 00:07:18.814
Lukia.

00:07:19.064 --> 00:07:25.321
It looks like I'll need to teach you again,
starting with how to smile.

00:07:35.789 --> 00:07:39.543
Vanships are much like the
world itself, don't you think?

00:07:39.793 --> 00:07:42.546
The world?

00:07:42.796 --> 00:07:47.051
Only now have they taken a standard form,

00:07:47.301 --> 00:07:50.512
but it used to be that each nation
had completely different Vanships.

00:07:50.763 --> 00:07:54.892
Now, those Vanships have
come together at this sacred lake

00:07:55.142 --> 00:07:57.686
to soar through the same, shared sky.

00:07:57.936 --> 00:08:00.648
Fellow inhabitants of this world,
striving for the same goal

00:08:00.898 --> 00:08:04.234
with their own hopes and dreams...

00:08:04.485 --> 00:08:06.612
Occasionally fighting each other,
occasionally accepting each other,

00:08:06.862 --> 00:08:10.616
all while holding respect
for each other's aspirations...

00:08:10.866 --> 00:08:15.454
Once that becomes possible,
this world will surely change!

00:08:15.704 --> 00:08:20.250
As ones bearing the future of Turan,
we'll have to work hard too, huh?

00:08:20.501 --> 00:08:24.797
Yeah! I'll study lots and lots
so I can help you, Sister!

00:08:25.047 --> 00:08:27.091
Thanks, Millia!

00:08:35.933 --> 00:08:38.185
So those are Glaciens?

00:08:38.435 --> 00:08:42.064
I've never seen one before;
they're pretty high-level!

00:08:42.314 --> 00:08:44.692
<i>Oh'. Those ones are from Notes'.!</i>

00:08:44.942 --> 00:08:47.277
Sorfish! We're on duty, you know!

00:08:47.528 --> 00:08:49.571
Nothing's gonna happen!

00:08:49.822 --> 00:08:53.075
Wow, I can't believe we get
to meet so many girls...

00:08:53.325 --> 00:08:55.619
The Augusta is truly great!

00:08:55.869 --> 00:08:59.373
Stop that! Don't sully the Augusta's
ideals with your depraved lechery!

00:08:59.623 --> 00:09:03.502
L-I'm just kidding!
Man, you're a real hothead, firang!

00:09:03.752 --> 00:09:05.629
You just don't know how
to take anything seriously!

00:09:09.133 --> 00:09:13.637
Kaiser and Atamora of Kartoffel
advance to the finals!

00:09:18.016 --> 00:09:20.227
I'm sorry. It's an old habit of mine...

00:09:20.477 --> 00:09:23.856
You use that to count prayers, right?

00:09:24.106 --> 00:09:25.023
Yes.

00:09:25.274 --> 00:09:32.156
But what I'm counting is the
number of sins I've committed...

00:09:32.406 --> 00:09:33.949
Sins?

00:09:38.579 --> 00:09:40.038
Millia?

00:10:06.565 --> 00:10:11.153
I wonder if my family's here somewhere...

00:10:20.746 --> 00:10:21.997
Hide-and-seek?

00:10:22.247 --> 00:10:23.207
Shh!

00:10:23.457 --> 00:10:24.583
Princess!

00:10:24.833 --> 00:10:26.251
--Check that way!
--Right!

00:10:26.502 --> 00:10:28.003
Princess!

00:10:28.253 --> 00:10:29.338
Don't tell anyone!

00:10:29.588 --> 00:10:31.423
Huh? Uhh...

00:10:31.673 --> 00:10:32.800
Please!

00:10:33.050 --> 00:10:34.510
Okay!

00:10:35.969 --> 00:10:39.223
Say, there! Have you seen
a little girl about your age?

00:10:39.473 --> 00:10:40.474
N°pe!

00:10:40.724 --> 00:10:41.600
Oh...

00:10:41.850 --> 00:10:43.185
Princess!

00:10:43.435 --> 00:10:45.312
--Princess! Where are you?!
--Princess!

00:10:45.562 --> 00:10:46.522
I think they left!

00:10:46.772 --> 00:10:48.273
Thank you!

00:10:50.192 --> 00:10:51.652
<i>Fm' you'.!</i>

00:10:55.531 --> 00:10:57.908
--Bye!
--Bye!

00:11:02.287 --> 00:11:05.874
Yashbal advances to the finals!

00:11:09.795 --> 00:11:11.964
Have you any idea how
much you worried everyone,

00:11:12.214 --> 00:11:16.218
going off by yourself like that?!

00:11:16.468 --> 00:11:19.346
--But...
--No excuses!

00:11:19.596 --> 00:11:23.559
You're a Turan princess!
You need to act like one!

00:11:23.809 --> 00:11:25.435
I'm sorry...

00:11:25.686 --> 00:11:30.524
Now, now, Liliana.
Today is a celebration of peace.

00:11:30.774 --> 00:11:33.026
Surely you can understand
Millia's desire to make merry...

00:11:33.277 --> 00:11:35.529
You pamper her too much, Father.

00:11:35.779 --> 00:11:39.116
Princess Liliana. I think that's enough.

00:11:39.366 --> 00:11:42.578
Princess Millia seems quite
regretful of her actions.

00:11:42.828 --> 00:11:45.372
Y-Yes...

00:11:45.622 --> 00:11:48.333
Now, hurry along.
The final race is about to begin!

00:11:49.626 --> 00:11:52.129
Right! Let's go, Millia!

00:12:13.609 --> 00:12:15.611
U-Umm...

00:12:15.861 --> 00:12:18.196
Th-Thank you...

00:12:18.447 --> 00:12:19.948
Not at all.

00:12:26.038 --> 00:12:28.081
Fam! Fam!

00:12:28.332 --> 00:12:30.417
--Gisey!
--Where were you?

00:12:30.667 --> 00:12:32.836
The final race is about to start!

00:12:36.214 --> 00:12:39.885
Yeah, I guess it wouldn't be
that easy to find 'em, huh?

00:12:40.135 --> 00:12:42.763
--Fam...
--Okay! Let's go, Gisey!

00:12:46.099 --> 00:12:48.936
Oh, yeah! Look, Gisey!

00:12:49.186 --> 00:12:50.479
What is this, Fam?

00:12:50.729 --> 00:12:53.857
--Candy?
--Wow, it's so pretty!

00:12:56.234 --> 00:12:58.320
I'm relieved, Lukia.

00:12:58.570 --> 00:13:01.531
You helped Princess Liliana of your own accord.

00:13:02.574 --> 00:13:04.910
He's inept, that's all.

00:13:05.160 --> 00:13:07.621
--Alauda.
--But it's true.

00:13:07.871 --> 00:13:11.625
Unfortunately, Princess Millia
appears to be afraid of him, though.

00:13:11.875 --> 00:13:15.504
Oh? Is that what led to all that trouble?

00:13:15.754 --> 00:13:17.464
Augusta...

00:13:19.466 --> 00:13:22.886
Don't act all high and mighty
just 'cause your marks are decent!

00:13:24.554 --> 00:13:25.931
What are you doing?

00:13:26.181 --> 00:13:28.183
A-Augusta!

00:13:28.433 --> 00:13:31.228
She doesn't deserve the honor of handing
Your Majesty's bouquet to the winner!

00:13:31.478 --> 00:13:34.815
This Chaos good-for-nothing owes
her life to Your Majesty's compassion!

00:13:35.065 --> 00:13:36.191
Be on your way.

00:13:36.441 --> 00:13:38.068
Y-Yes, Your Majesty!

00:13:40.320 --> 00:13:42.614
You all right?

00:13:42.864 --> 00:13:44.491
Augusta Farahnéz...

00:13:44.741 --> 00:13:50.372
I... truly respect Your Majesty
from the bottom of my heart!

00:13:50.622 --> 00:13:55.460
Your Majesty's wish to unite the world and
end the fighting through mutual dialogue!

00:13:55.711 --> 00:13:57.129
Itruly...!

00:13:57.379 --> 00:14:00.090
Rise.

00:14:00.340 --> 00:14:01.675
Thank you.

00:14:01.925 --> 00:14:06.430
Please continue to lend your support,
for the betterment of the world.

00:14:06.680 --> 00:14:08.849
L-I will!

00:14:12.894 --> 00:14:15.188
That was a Chaosian?

00:14:15.439 --> 00:14:18.233
We annexed them so
long ago, yet they're still...

00:14:18.483 --> 00:14:22.029
The true difficulties still lie ahead.

00:14:22.279 --> 00:14:24.573
Even with peace agreements in place,

00:14:24.823 --> 00:14:27.743
the world will still be far from united.

00:14:27.993 --> 00:14:31.371
As long as the memories of war
still reside within people,

00:14:31.621 --> 00:14:35.208
hatred and discrimination
will never fully disappear.

00:14:35.459 --> 00:14:37.461
There are still many challenges to overcome

00:14:37.711 --> 00:14:43.008
if we are to lessen the sadness
held by that girl and those like her.

00:14:44.468 --> 00:14:46.762
You are the cornerstone of this world.

00:14:48.597 --> 00:14:50.932
I fully appreciate your ambition.

00:14:51.183 --> 00:14:56.063
However, we cannot afford to lose
you in your effort to achieve it...

00:14:56.313 --> 00:14:58.440
Lu kia is correct.

00:14:58.690 --> 00:15:03.945
Without you, the world
will be lost... As will we...

00:15:04.196 --> 00:15:09.451
There is only very little I can do alone.

00:15:12.204 --> 00:15:14.956
Lukia. Alauda.

00:15:15.207 --> 00:15:23.298
From now on, I ask that you protect
not only me, but this world as well.

00:15:23.548 --> 00:15:25.467
Augusta Farahnéz!

00:15:27.260 --> 00:15:29.763
We're here to pick you up!

00:16:02.921 --> 00:16:05.298
Dad's in the lead!

00:16:07.300 --> 00:16:12.180
And the winners of the 1st Grand Race
are Kaiser and Atamora!

00:16:15.183 --> 00:16:18.520
They did it! Dad and Kaiser won!

00:16:20.605 --> 00:16:22.065
<i>F am?</i>

00:16:23.859 --> 00:16:25.986
Everyone's smiling...

00:16:26.236 --> 00:16:29.614
Someday I wanna fly!

00:16:29.865 --> 00:16:33.326
With everyone smiling like this!

00:16:33.577 --> 00:16:38.290
Everyone... People who know me
and people who don't know me!

00:16:41.918 --> 00:16:43.545
Fam...

00:16:46.923 --> 00:16:49.050
--We won!
--Whadya think of that?!

00:16:49.301 --> 00:16:51.344
Dad!

00:16:55.056 --> 00:16:57.517
Look closely...

00:16:57.767 --> 00:16:59.269
...S5r5.

00:17:48.526 --> 00:17:50.153
There, there...

00:17:53.323 --> 00:17:58.370
I congratulate you on your victory
in this prestigious 1st Grand Race.

00:18:02.832 --> 00:18:05.418
Atamora! Kaiser!

00:18:05.669 --> 00:18:08.213
These children who will
shoulder the coming world

00:18:08.463 --> 00:18:10.298
will now present flowers to the victors.

00:18:15.053 --> 00:18:16.805
Farahniz!

00:18:24.729 --> 00:18:29.609
Thank you... for the bouquet...

00:18:29.859 --> 00:18:31.361
Kaiser!

00:18:32.570 --> 00:18:34.823
Kaiser! Kaiser!

00:18:35.073 --> 00:18:36.283
Ades must pay!

00:18:36.533 --> 00:18:38.451
The time for retribution has come!

00:18:48.712 --> 00:18:50.171
Please stay back.

00:18:53.341 --> 00:18:55.093
--Father!
--Get back, Guzel!

00:18:55.343 --> 00:18:56.928
Lady Farahnéz!

00:19:01.975 --> 00:19:04.185
--S5r5!
--I'll help her!

00:19:27.083 --> 00:19:28.460
Atamora! Kaiser!

00:19:28.710 --> 00:19:31.296
--Fam!
--Atamora!

00:19:45.935 --> 00:19:48.021
Liliana!

00:19:48.271 --> 00:19:50.732
Father! Father!

00:19:50.982 --> 00:19:52.442
Why...?!

00:19:52.692 --> 00:19:54.277
Why did this"?!

00:19:54.527 --> 00:19:56.446
Augusta Farahnéz!

00:20:07.916 --> 00:20:11.586
A-Augusta Farahnéz?

00:20:11.836 --> 00:20:13.254
It's all right...

00:20:13.505 --> 00:20:15.799
It's... all right...

00:20:22.013 --> 00:20:23.973
A-Augusta Farahnéz!

00:20:24.224 --> 00:20:27.143
Augusta Farahnéz!

00:20:28.353 --> 00:20:30.355
The dictator is dead.

00:20:30.605 --> 00:20:31.815
Everyone...

00:20:32.065 --> 00:20:35.110
You've... been avenged!

00:20:39.155 --> 00:20:41.991
Augusta Farahnéz...

00:20:57.298 --> 00:20:58.883
Monster!

00:21:10.019 --> 00:21:11.771
You too?

00:21:12.021 --> 00:21:13.857
YOU too?!

00:21:18.653 --> 00:21:20.155
Lukia...

00:21:31.124 --> 00:21:37.297
I will protect you! I will always
keep you safe, young Lady Sari!

00:21:37.547 --> 00:21:39.132
So...!

00:21:41.593 --> 00:21:44.554
You too? You too...?

00:21:44.804 --> 00:21:46.181
YOU too?!

00:21:46.431 --> 00:21:48.099
That's enough...

00:21:48.349 --> 00:21:50.935
That's enough, Lukia...

00:21:51.186 --> 00:21:53.229
Please! Let me die!

00:21:53.480 --> 00:21:56.149
Let me die alongside Augusta Farahnéz!

00:21:56.399 --> 00:21:58.359
Why?

00:21:58.610 --> 00:22:02.947
How did... How did it turn out this way?

00:22:31.100 --> 00:22:36.606
<i>How high are the skies,</i>

00:22:36.856 --> 00:22:42.654
<i>how strong are the winds,</i>

00:22:42.904 --> 00:22:48.493
<i>how clear are the waters</i>

00:22:48.743 --> 00:22:55.792
<i>you hold in your heart?</i>

00:22:57.001 --> 00:23:08.471
<i>One day I want to be the palm
of your hand and catch your tears</i>

00:23:08.721 --> 00:23:20.567
<i>I want us to share the
same sorrows, the same air</i>

00:23:20.817 --> 00:23:26.406
<i>I'll point the prow of this departing ship</i>

00:23:26.656 --> 00:23:35.206
<i>Right your way with no hesitation</i>

00:23:35.456 --> 00:23:41.170
<i>Let's raise the mast in this sea of wind</i>

00:23:41.421 --> 00:23:46.968
<i>And set sail on these waves of clouds</i>

00:23:47.218 --> 00:23:52.724
<i>With the faraway stars for a compass</i>

00:23:52.974 --> 00:24:00.648
<i>I'll head beyond the horizon with you</i>

00:24:03.568 --> 00:24:05.403
<i>What have we gotten ourselves into?!</i>

00:24:05.653 --> 00:24:07.363
<i>And more importantly, where are we?!</i>

00:24:07.447 --> 00:24:11.034
<i>Glacies. It's what you know
as the "northern nation."</i>

00:24:11.117 --> 00:24:13.786
<i>Whoa, who are you?! And you're
talking in some weird language!</i>

00:24:14.037 --> 00:24:15.580
<i>Whoa! It's totally white outside!</i>

00:24:15.830 --> 00:24:18.374
<i>Snow! Snow! There's snow everywhere!</i>

00:24:18.458 --> 00:24:22.003
<i>You're that excited by snow?
You're more of a kid than I thought...</i>

00:24:23.046 --> 00:24:25.423
<i>I dunno who you are,
but now you're covered in snow!</i>

00:24:25.506 --> 00:24:28.092
<i>I shouldn't have saved you...</i>
